If I model subsets of data, some sites are dropped which makes me concerned about uneven sample sizes if I use subsets of data. But this may be the only solution.

I am taking out a couple days due to the starting NA columns (hours) in which I hadn't deployed any ARUs until later in the day.

 I am modeling bird occupancy and relating that occupancy to food source seasonality, I would think a dynamic occupancy model makes sense....?

